{"seq":3,"slug":"instant-delivery-ops-monitor","title":"秒发成功率与异常监控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/cross-border-digital-goods-delivery/fraud-refund-revoke/instant-delivery-ops-monitor","wordCount":2249,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"秒发成功率与异常监控\">秒发成功率与异常监控</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>秒发成功率（instant fulfillment success rate）是这类平台最核心的复合指标：它同时受支付成功率、凭证池可用量、上游供应商响应时间、以及本地履约逻辑的正确性影响。任何一环劣化，它都会下降——这正是它作为北向指标的价值，也是它作为排查起点的不足：它只告诉你「变差了」，不告诉你「哪里变差了」。</p>\n<p>因此监控体系需要三层：<strong>北向指标</strong>（秒发成功率与交付时延）用于定 SLO 和告警；<strong>分解指标</strong>（支付、池子、上游、履约）用于归因；<strong>饱和指标</strong>（池子水位、上游配额）用于预警——第三层最关键，因为它是唯一能在用户受影响<strong>之前</strong>发出信号的层。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[支付授权] --&gt; B[履约单创建]&#10;  B --&gt; C[凭证预占]&#10;  C --&gt; D[凭证签发]&#10;  D --&gt; E[交付展示/通知]&#10;  A -.支付成功率.-&gt; M[分解指标]&#10;  C -.池子可用量.-&gt; M&#10;  D -.上游响应时延.-&gt; M&#10;  E -.交付时延.-&gt; M&#10;  M --&gt; N[秒发成功率&lt;br/&gt;北向 SLO]&#10;  O[池子水位/上游配额] --&gt; P[饱和预警&lt;br/&gt;窗口 小时级]&#10;  N --&gt; Q[多窗口多燃烧率告警]&#10;  P --&gt; R[补货动作]\">graph TD\n  A[支付授权] --&gt; B[履约单创建]\n  B --&gt; C[凭证预占]\n  C --&gt; D[凭证签发]\n  D --&gt; E[交付展示/通知]\n  A -.支付成功率.-&gt; M[分解指标]\n  C -.池子可用量.-&gt; M\n  D -.上游响应时延.-&gt; M\n  E -.交付时延.-&gt; M\n  M --&gt; N[秒发成功率&lt;br/&gt;北向 SLO]\n  O[池子水位/上游配额] --&gt; P[饱和预警&lt;br/&gt;窗口 小时级]\n  N --&gt; Q[多窗口多燃烧率告警]\n  P --&gt; R[补货动作]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标层</th>\n<th>代表指标</th>\n<th>采样粒度</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>告警方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>北向</td>\n<td>秒发成功率 P99 交付时延</td>\n<td>1 分钟</td>\n<td>SLO 达标判定</td>\n<td>多窗口燃烧率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分解</td>\n<td>支付成功率、池消耗失败率、上游 P95 时延</td>\n<td>1 分钟</td>\n<td>归因定位</td>\n<td>单指标静态阈值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>饱和</td>\n<td>池可用量 / 低水位、上游配额余量</td>\n<td>5 分钟</td>\n<td>提前预警</td>\n<td>水位阈值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>业务</td>\n<td>退款率、拒付率、兑换失败率</td>\n<td>1 小时</td>\n<td>健康度与风控</td>\n<td>趋势偏离</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"slo-的定义与燃烧率告警\">SLO 的定义与燃烧率告警</h2><h3 id=\"秒发成功率不是二值指标\">秒发成功率不是二值指标</h3><p>「秒发」需要一个明确定义的时间界。把它定义成「支付确认到凭证可见」的时延落在某个分位数内，比定义成「成功/失败」更准确，因为用户感知的是时延而不是布尔值。常用做法是双指标：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>L</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">#</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext>交付成功</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">#</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext>支付成功</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>S</mi><mi>L</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>99</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>支付确认</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>凭证可见</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SLO_{succ} = \\frac{\\#\\{\\text{交付成功}\\}}{\\#\\{\\text{支付成功}\\}}, \\qquad SLO_{lat} = P_{99}(\\text{支付确认} \\to \\text{凭证可见})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">cc</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">#</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">支付成功</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">#</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">交付成功</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">99</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">支付确认</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">凭证可见</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>设定 SLO 时要先明确「哪些算成功」。合理的口径是把「补偿后成功」也计入成功，但单独统计<strong>首次尝试成功率</strong>——两者的差值就是系统的重试负担，它变大意味着底层在抖动。</p>\n<h3 id=\"多窗口多燃烧率\">多窗口多燃烧率</h3><p>错误预算燃烧率的思路来自 Google SRE 工作簿：用多个时间窗口与多个燃烧率阈值组合，短窗口抓突发、长窗口抓缓慢劣化，从而同时获得高精确率与高召回率。工作簿明确的一句提醒是，这种固定预算比例的方法精度好，而三日窗口带来良好的召回（见 <a href=\"https://sre.google/workbook/alerting-on-slos/\">Google SRE Workbook: Alerting on SLOs</a>）。一个可直接落地的参数组合：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>严重度</th>\n<th>长窗口</th>\n<th>短窗口</th>\n<th>燃烧率阈值</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Page</td>\n<td>1 小时</td>\n<td>5 分钟</td>\n<td>14.4</td>\n<td>1 小时内烧掉 2% 月预算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Page</td>\n<td>6 小时</td>\n<td>30 分钟</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>6 小时内烧掉 5%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ticket</td>\n<td>3 天</td>\n<td>6 小时</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>3 天内烧掉 10%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>用 PromQL 表达的双窗口判据（两个窗口必须同时超阈值才告警，短窗口负责快速恢复）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"promql\" data-code=\"(&#10;  sum(rate(fulfillment_failed_total[1h])) / sum(rate(fulfillment_total[1h])) &gt; 14.4 * 0.001&#10;  and&#10;  sum(rate(fulfillment_failed_total[5m])) / sum(rate(fulfillment_total[5m])) &gt; 14.4 * 0.001&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  sum(rate(fulfillment_failed_total[1h])) / sum(rate(fulfillment_total[1h])) > 14.4 * 0.001</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  and</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  sum(rate(fulfillment_failed_total[5m])) / sum(rate(fulfillment_total[5m])) > 14.4 * 0.001</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"低流量-sku-不能套用同一套告警\">低流量 SKU 不能套用同一套告警</h3><p>工作簿专门讨论了低流量服务的问题：请求很少时单次失败会造成极大的燃烧率，从而立即触发告警，而这类单次失败往往是短暂且不值得追查的原因。其给出的例子是每小时 10 个请求的服务，一次失败即代表 10% 的小时错误率，对 99.9% 的 SLO 来说相当于 1000 倍燃烧率，会立刻告警，而它消耗了 30 天错误预算的 13.9%（见 <a href=\"https://sre.google/workbook/alerting-on-slos/\">Google SRE Workbook: Alerting on SLOs</a>）。对数字商品平台，这对应的是长尾 SKU：它们的秒发失败按 SKU 维度看会是噪声，因此告警必须<strong>按供应商或按 SKU 分组合并</strong>，而不是按单个 SKU 设阈值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分解指标-把复合指标拆开\">分解指标：把复合指标拆开</h2><h3 id=\"四个可归因的分母\">四个可归因的分母</h3><p>秒发成功率的下降必然来自四个环节之一，把每一环都做成独立的成功率，归因就变成查表：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>环节</th>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>典型劣化原因</th>\n<th>排查入口</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>支付</td>\n<td>授权成功率、<code>decline_code</code> 分布</td>\n<td>风控误杀、发卡行拒绝、卡测活</td>\n<td>见 4.1 的失败分布</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>池子</td>\n<td>预占失败率、可用量水位</td>\n<td>缺货、补货未达、批次过期</td>\n<td>见 1.3 的水位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上游</td>\n<td>申领 P95 时延、错误率、配额余量</td>\n<td>供应商抖动、限流</td>\n<td>见 1.3 的 L2/L3 降级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>履约</td>\n<td>签发失败率、凭证状态异常数</td>\n<td>唯一约束冲突、逻辑缺陷</td>\n<td>见 2.1 的补偿路径</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个实用的技巧是给每条履约失败记录打上<strong>归因标签</strong>，让「失败原因分布」成为一个可直接查询的维度，而不是事后翻日志：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT date_trunc(&#39;hour&#39;, created_at) AS hour,&#10;       failure_reason,&#10;       count(*) AS n,&#10;       percentile_disc(0.95) WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY latency_ms) AS p95_ms&#10;  FROM fulfillment&#10; WHERE state = &#39;failed&#39; AND created_at &gt; now() - interval &#39;24 hours&#39;&#10; GROUP BY 1, 2&#10; ORDER BY 1 DESC, n DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> date_trunc(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'hour'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, created_at) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> hour</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       failure_reason,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       percentile_disc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">95</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITHIN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> GROUP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> latency_ms) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p95_ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fulfillment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'failed'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> created_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'24 hours'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"唯一约束冲突必须单独监控\">唯一约束冲突必须单独监控</h3><p><a href=\"../instant-fulfillment/post-pay-instant-issuance\">支付成功即时发卡/激活</a> 里用部分唯一索引保证了「一个订单至多一条已发凭证」。这个约束被触发时的表现是<strong>插入失败</strong>，而不是静默发两张卡——这是好事，但它意味着系统在重试。因此「唯一约束冲突次数」是一个高价值指标：正常情况下它应当接近零，持续非零说明幂等去重逻辑有漏洞，或者上游在重复投递事件。它下降得越晚，越多的重试流量会累积。</p>\n<h2 id=\"饱和预警-用户受影响之前\">饱和预警：用户受影响之前</h2><h3 id=\"池子水位是最重要的先行指标\">池子水位是最重要的先行指标</h3><p>秒发成功率是<strong>滞后</strong>指标：它下降时已经有用户拿不到货了。池子可用量是<strong>先行</strong>指标：它降到低水位时，距离失败还有一段可预测的时间（等于补货前置时间）。因此告警应当同时挂在水位与燃烧率上：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 每小时评估: 预计耗尽时间 &lt; 补货前置时间的 1.5 倍&#10;WITH burn AS (&#10;  SELECT pool_id,&#10;         (SELECT count(*) FROM voucher v&#10;           WHERE v.pool_id = p.id AND v.status = &#39;available&#39;) AS avail,&#10;         COALESCE(sum(cnt) FILTER (WHERE at &gt; now() - interval &#39;1 hour&#39;), 0) AS burn_1h&#10;    FROM voucher_pool p&#10;    LEFT JOIN pool_consumption c ON c.pool_id = p.id&#10;   GROUP BY p.id, p.id&#10;)&#10;SELECT pool_id, avail, burn_1h,&#10;       CASE WHEN burn_1h &gt; 0 THEN round(avail::numeric / burn_1h, 1) END AS hours_left&#10;  FROM burn&#10; WHERE avail &lt; 1.5 * burn_1h&#10;    OR avail = 0&#10; ORDER BY hours_left NULLS FIRST;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 每小时评估: 预计耗尽时间 &#x3C; 补货前置时间的 1.5 倍</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> burn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pool_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">         (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> voucher v</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">pool_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'available'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> avail,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cnt) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1 hour'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> burn_1h</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> voucher_pool p</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pool_consumption c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">pool_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pool_id, avail, burn_1h,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> burn_1h </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(avail::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> burn_1h, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hours_left</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> burn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> avail </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> burn_1h</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    OR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> avail </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hours_left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NULLS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FIRST</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>hours_left</code> 这个「可售小时数」比绝对水位更有沟通效率：运营看到「还剩 0.8 小时」会立刻行动，看到「还剩 400 条」则无法判断紧急程度。</p>\n<h3 id=\"上游配额与供应商健康度\">上游配额与供应商健康度</h3><p>上游供应商的配额余量与错误率是两个独立信号。配额余量归零会导致 L3 停售，而错误率升高先表现为时延上升（用户等待变长），再表现为失败。因此供应商健康度应当按<strong>错误率 + P95 时延 + 配额余量</strong>三个维度打分，并据此驱动 <a href=\"../digital-goods-catalog/digital-inventory-restock\">数字库存补货与售罄模型</a> 里的 L1/L2/L3 降级决策。把降级决策与健康度评分绑定，可以避免「凭手感降级」导致的长尾 SKU 被过早停售。</p>\n<h2 id=\"业务侧异常与风控联动\">业务侧异常与风控联动</h2><h3 id=\"兑换失败率是双重信号\">兑换失败率是双重信号</h3><p>兑换失败率上升有两种解释：一批码有问题（上游发了无效码，见 1.3），或者有人在撞库（见 <a href=\"card-pool-fraud-abuse\">卡密盗刷与薅羊毛防护</a>）。区分方法是看失败的<strong>分布</strong>：集中在某个批次 → 供应商质量问题；分散且伴随高比例的「不存在」→ 撞库。因此两个指标必须能按 <code>batch_id</code> 与 <code>code_shape</code> 下钻。</p>\n<h3 id=\"退款率与拒付率的趋势\">退款率与拒付率的趋势</h3><p>退款率与拒付率的绝对值通常不高，但它们的<strong>趋势</strong>是有价值的：拒付率上升往往晚于卡测活（见 4.1），因为这个周期的长度取决于发卡行的对账周期。因此监控上应当把拒付率与前置的授权失败分布放在同一个看板上，让「授权失败先升、拒付率后升」这个因果链可见。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组合信号</th>\n<th>最可能的解释</th>\n<th>首要动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>池子水位低 + 秒发失败升</td>\n<td>缺货</td>\n<td>触发补货，必要时停售</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上游 P95 升 + 履约重试升</td>\n<td>供应商抖动</td>\n<td>进入 L2 限流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>授权失败分布异常 + 拒付率升</td>\n<td>卡测活</td>\n<td>收紧首单限额，见 4.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>兑换 not_found 升 + 分散</td>\n<td>撞库</td>\n<td>账号/IP 限速</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>兑换失败集中某批次</td>\n<td>供应商发错码</td>\n<td>停用批次，向供应商索赔</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>唯一约束冲突 &gt; 0</td>\n<td>幂等逻辑缺陷</td>\n<td>排查事件重复投递</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>秒发成功率是复合北向指标，必须配分解指标（支付/池子/上游/履约）与饱和指标（水位/配额）三层，后者是唯一能在用户受影响前预警的层。</li>\n<li>用双指标定义 SLO：成功率与 P99 交付时延；同时区分首次尝试成功率与补偿后成功率，两者的差值是系统抖动负担。</li>\n<li>告警用多窗口多燃烧率（1 小时/5 分钟 @14.4、6 小时/30 分钟 @6、3 天/6 小时 @1），短窗口负责快速恢复；低流量 SKU 必须按供应商分组合并，不能逐 SKU 设阈值。</li>\n<li>履约失败必须打归因标签并落库；唯一约束冲突持续非零说明幂等有漏洞或上游在重复投递事件。</li>\n<li>池子的「可售小时数」比绝对水位更适合驱动运营动作；兑换失败率按批次与码形状下钻，可区分供应商质量问题与撞库。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"秒发成功率与异常监控","id":"秒发成功率与异常监控"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"SLO 的定义与燃烧率告警","id":"slo-的定义与燃烧率告警"},{"level":3,"text":"秒发成功率不是二值指标","id":"秒发成功率不是二值指标"},{"level":3,"text":"多窗口多燃烧率","id":"多窗口多燃烧率"},{"level":3,"text":"低流量 SKU 不能套用同一套告警","id":"低流量-sku-不能套用同一套告警"},{"level":2,"text":"分解指标：把复合指标拆开","id":"分解指标-把复合指标拆开"},{"level":3,"text":"四个可归因的分母","id":"四个可归因的分母"},{"level":3,"text":"唯一约束冲突必须单独监控","id":"唯一约束冲突必须单独监控"},{"level":2,"text":"饱和预警：用户受影响之前","id":"饱和预警-用户受影响之前"},{"level":3,"text":"池子水位是最重要的先行指标","id":"池子水位是最重要的先行指标"},{"level":3,"text":"上游配额与供应商健康度","id":"上游配额与供应商健康度"},{"level":2,"text":"业务侧异常与风控联动","id":"业务侧异常与风控联动"},{"level":3,"text":"兑换失败率是双重信号","id":"兑换失败率是双重信号"},{"level":3,"text":"退款率与拒付率的趋势","id":"退款率与拒付率的趋势"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"数字商品退款与授权回收","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/cross-border-digital-goods-delivery/fraud-refund-revoke/digital-refund-license-revoke"},"next":null}